.Sh DIAGNOSTICS
.Bl -diag
.It "[kvm-mesh] VM is not running \(em skipped"
.It "[kvm-mesh] VM has no reachable address \(em skipped"
.It "[kvm-mesh] VM has no 'wg' in the guest \(em install wireguard-tools there first"
.It "[kvm-mesh] VM: key generation failed \(em skipped"
.It "[kvm-mesh] VM: could not bring up MESH \(em skipped"
The machine is left out; the others carry on.
.It "[kvm-mesh] no VM joined \(em nothing to peer"
.It "[kvm-mesh] VM (ADDRESS) did not answer; its MESH goes when it next boots (it is not persistent)"
From
.Cm down .
.El
